  "translation": "Today is the weekend. My friend and I went shopping together. We first arrived at the mall. I walked into a clothing store and took a fancy to a shirt. This shirt is blue. I asked the salesperson how much it was. She said three hundred yuan. I thought it was too expensive, but my friend thought it was very cheap. Finally, I bought it. Then we went to a cafe downstairs and ordered a cup of latte. The coffee was very fragrant. We sat by the window looking at the outside scenery. At this moment, my friend said we should go home immediately. But I still wanted to watch a movie, so we went to the cinema. The movie was wonderful. After watching the movie, we happily went home."
